# Ruby, Daring Tracker: the condition "while you control a creature with power 4 or greater" is checked as she attacks and not again
# as the trigger resolves (it is not an intervening "if", CR 603.4). On turn 3 Bot1 controls Surrak, Elusive Hunter (a 4/3) and attacks
# with Ruby; Bot2 answers the trigger with Lightning Bolt on Surrak, which dies, and Ruby is still a 3/4 and deals 3 (Bot2 at 17).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Ruby, Daring Tracker
Surrak, Elusive Hunter
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

